  <name>OfxHost</name>
  <summary>Still-image OpenFX plugin host</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      A minimal still-image OpenFX host. Open a RAW or PNG, JPEG, TIFF, or EXR
      photo, run it through one or more OFX filter plugins, preview the result,
      and export to PNG, JPEG, WebP, JPEG XL, or 16-bit TIFF.
    </p>
